OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer who raped teenager is
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer who raped and exploited a
OL,7,Fteenage girl has been jailed.
OL,9,FJames Conroy, 43, of no fixed abode,
OL,10,Fwas arrested after allegations he was
OL,11,Fgrooming the victim, Cambridge Crown
OL,12,FCourt heard.
OL,14,FHe later began sending her threatening
OL,15,Fand degrading messages. Police searches
OL,16,Fin Ely, Cambridgeshire, uncovered bags
OL,17,Fof cocaine with a street value of about
OL,18,F#1,000.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
