OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer who raped teenager is
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FConroy was found guilty of a range of
OL,7,Fcharges, including rape and supplying
OL,8,Fcocaine. On Wednesday, he was sentenced
OL,9,Fto 22 years and six months in prison.
